<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Vitafoam Q3 profits lower.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Vitafoam Q3 profits lower.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigerian Vitafoam third quarter results to end September 1996 (In million naira).</p>
<p>				    1996	 1995</p>
<p> Turnover			360.4   vs 262.7</p>
<p> Profit before taxation     21.2   vs  52.2</p>
<p> Taxation			  6.8   vs  19.3</p>
<p> Profit after taxation	14.4   vs  32.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Company officials said the high cost of operations was responsible for a decrease in profit margin despite an increase in turnover.</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
